Z||000000||fierodude||06-22-2001||01:21 PM||||yesterday i bought a 3.1 off of 85blackgt for $300 90k what mods do i have to make to put it in my car?  ddoes the transmission bolt up to this motor?  its out of a grand prix can anyone help??<P>------------------<BR>slice the rice! it dosen't pay to drive jap - crap!||||reg||12
Z||000001||Steve Normington||06-22-2001||01:31 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by fierodude:<BR><B>yesterday i bought a 3.1 off of 85blackgt for $300 90k what mods do i have to make to put it in my car?  ddoes the transmission bolt up to this motor?  its out of a grand prix can anyone help??</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>The 3.1 is the same as the 2.8 except a different crank. The only mod you might need is to change the flywheel/flexplate if your 2.8 is externally balanced. The way to tell is if the old fly/flex has a big chuck of metal welded on the back, then it is external. If the fly/flex from the 3.1 won't fit, then you need one from an 88 Fiero.<P>||||reg||1
